priate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/evcohen/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/master/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md","JSXOpeningElement","no-global-assign","no-unsafe-negation",{"desc":"136","fix":"137"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [counter, onPaginationChange, showPerPage]",{"range":"138","text":"139"},[363,372],"[counter, onPaginationChange, showPerPage]"]